"P2794131616" "At Hard Luck's request, you cut off the beard of the Tsoo warrior, Lucky Dragon. It will serve as a trophy to remind people of what happens if they get on the wrong side of the Golden Giza."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P580773819" "So, {VillainName}, is it? Never heard of ya. Now, don't get touchy. We here in St. Martial see a lot of action. You help us out, and I can cut you in for a piece of  it. <br><br>To start off, we've got ourselves a Tsoo warrior up to no good in the Golden Giza. He's cleared six hundred G's at Craps this week alone. Now, I don't know that he's cheating, and I don't much care. The point is to send a message. Let people know that if you mess with the casino, the casino messes with you. </a>I want you to get Lucky Dragon's beard.<A HREF={ACCEPT}>"
// AcceptString :
"P3469298876" "Get Lucky Dragon's beard"
// SendOffString :
"P2925574704" "This will send a message to everyone who thinks they can get rich off the Golden Giza. Got it?"
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2049075151" "Beat Lucky Dragon & his guards"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2632988864" "I want Lucky Dragon's beard as a trophy. Understood?"

