// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL6_SM_Hard_Luck_Mission5 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1306222913" "The Family's got problems, {VillainName}. Big ones. See, Arachnos expects a certain kickback in exchange for protection here on the Rogue Isles. Problem is, the Giza's been pulling in a little more money than we've let on. Now one of the Arachnos oversight offices has found out about it, and there's definitely going to be fallout. The only way to fix this is to work fast. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Eliminate that oversight office.</a> You only have 45 minutes to wipe out everyone there."
// AcceptString :
"P544104345" "Eliminate the oversight office"
// SendOffString :
"P2922401890" "Everyone has to go down."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3964554387" "Defeat all operatives in base"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1029524704" "You haven't got much time, {VillainName}. If you don't move quick, the Family stands to lose a lot."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P541271592" "Beating up on Arachnos personnel is a dangerous, if diverting, pastime."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - ACTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ACTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P502952942" "Lord Recluse won't be pleased when he learns the Family has cheated him of his rightful tribute."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - ACTOR2_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ACTOR2_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3043753948" "He had to expect it, though, right?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - ACTOR_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ACTOR_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3719005728" "It's one of the Family's thugs!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4072725139" "You eliminated the entire oversight office."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskFailure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3489335475" "The oversight office got a message off to Arachnos."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1095292407" "You've managed to keep a lid on the situation, for now at least. Arachnos will never hear about the Family's extra profits, and that means they can keep them. It also means more jobs for you, {VillainName}. You're someone we can really depend on."
// RandomFameString :
"P810106188" "I hear Arachnos thinks {VillainName} did them wrong, but no one can prove it."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnFailure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2620340042" "Nice going, {VillainName}. And by nice going, I mean you stink. You let that oversight office get a message off to Arachnos about the Family's extra casino profits. Now we owe Arachnos a substantial tribute, plus there's gonna be fallout from this for months. You're lucky you've done well for us before, or you'd be sleeping with the fishes."
// RandomFameString :
"P2322881010" "I hear the Family's pretty ticked at {VillainName}."
